---
title: 'Character & Light Cone Progression Calculator'
---

Character and Light Cone detail pages now include a progression calculator. Adjust the target Level and, for Characters, skill levels and Trace activation state to see the required EXP Materials, Ascension Materials, Trace Materials, and Credits update in real time.

To toggle the activation state of a certain Trace node, just click on its card. 

Select a Material in the cost list will open Item Details, so you can read its descriptions. This update also improves the progression panel and Trace interaction feedback.
